{"type":"text","timestamp":1789782758069,"sessionID":"ses_f48a39245ffey7PBbEFyhaW1Ud","part":{"id":"prt_0b75d8495001WZU2zTO7aJ0qK2","messageID":"msg_0b75d7cc40017tgbtcmJQFGzJS","sessionID":"ses_f48a39245ffey7PBbEFyhaW1Ud","type":"text","text":"Fixed in `src/search/controller.ts` with a per-controller search version counter.\n\n- Only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading.\n- Clearing the query immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests, so their completion cannot restore results or errors.\n- Public API and normal search behavior are preserved.\n\n**Verification**\n- `npm test`: all 4 existing tests passed.\n- Additional in-memory checks passed for stale successes and failures, both completion orders, and clearing pending searches.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n\nNo tests were modified and no dependencies were installed.","time":{"start":1789782754453,"end":1789782758068},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_00a362ffb0cda566016aadeae262d887d18278a016a0caf6ec","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
